#04/24/2020
Erin Wrobel - Education Researcher

##Final Report Locations
* Pdf and CSV formats of qualtrics survey are uploaded
* Results interpretation is visible in final presentation
* Initial results were from a very limited sample size

##Recommendations and Interpretation
* Diagrams included in survey and proposed data formats need to be explained better
* Navigable format is preferred to Waterfall/Data dump
* Responses indicate the app would be useful in the classroom
* Instructors are most interested in measures of student engagement
* Instructors were not interested in cognitive presence measures
* Suspected that instructors didn't know what "cognitive presence" and other data formats meant
* Ease of access and interpretability of information is more important than display or even content
* Focus on student engagement, in particular how to make the cognitive presence measures applicable
